cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Humanities Data Modeling - Student Projects Showcase
message: >-
  If you reference these student projects, please cite them using the metadata
  below. Each project folder also contains individual citation information.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Students
    name-particle: Course
    given-names: Various
    affiliation: >-
      Foundations of Humanities Data Modeling and Formats Course - Sofia University "St. Kliment Ohridski"
description: >-
  A collection of student projects demonstrating practical application of 
  humanities data modeling principles. Projects showcase data format conversion, 
  tidy data principles, and real-world datasets in ancient history, numismatics, 
  epigraphy, and historical geography.
